-------------------------------------------------------------

Interactive Rebase

> git rebase -i HEAD~4



> Running git rebase with the -i option will enter the interactive mode
  which allows us to edit commits, add files, drop commits etc..

> Note that we need to specify how far back we want to go to rewritten commit.

> Also, notice that we are not rebasing into another branch.
  Instead, we are rebasing series of commits onto the HEAD they currently based on.

